{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "As he opened his eyes, the familiar surroundings of his apartment seemed off. The couch was a shade too bright, the TV glowed with an otherworldly light, and the window outside showed a cityscape that, while similar, lacked the grime and grit of reality. It started with small things: the too-perfect fold of his shirt on the back of the chair, the clock on the wall ticking in a rhythm that was almost, but not quite, natural. Then, the realization hit him like a ton of bricks - he was inside a video game.\n\n***\n\nPanic set in as he stumbled through his day, every interaction feeling like a scripted event. His coworkers' conversations were loops of mundane chatter, the barista's smile a little too wide and persistent. He tried to deviate from the routine, to see if he could break the mold, but every attempt was met with glitches - a character repeating lines, a door that wouldn't open, no matter how hard he tried. The world around him was beautifully rendered, yet hollow, a facade with no depth. And he, the protagonist in this unintended game, was desperate to find a way out, or at least understand the rules of this bizarre, pixelated existence.", "logprobs": [{"token": "As", "logprob": -0.9918688535690308}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.10845297574996948}, {"token": " opened", "logprob": -0.129058837890625}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " eyes", "logprob": -2.145764938177308e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00010895135346800089}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.017775164917111397}, {"token": " familiar", "logprob": -0.15628229081630707}, {"token": " surroundings", "logprob": -0.49396610260009766}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": " apartment", "logprob": -0.05317579209804535}, {"token": " seemed", "logprob": -0.19359806